# civil-holidays v1
# jurisdiction: AU
# source: https://www.fairwork.gov.au/employment-conditions/public-holidays
#   (Fair Work Ombudsman national + state/territory public holidays) and the
#   Western Australia King's Birthday proclamations
#   https://www.wa.gov.au/service/employment/public-holidays/public-holidays-western-australia
#   Australia Day, New Year, Christmas and Boxing Day are observed the following
#   Monday when they fall on a weekend (sat_sun_mon).
# retrieved: 2026-07-21
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed
#
# --- national ---
fixed       | New Year's Day  | 1 1    | public          |       | sat_sun_mon
