easter      | Easter Monday   | 1      | public religious |       |
fixed       | ANZAC Day       | 4 25   | public          |       |
fixed       | Christmas Day   | 12 25  | public religious |       | sat_sun_mon
fixed       | Boxing Day      | 12 26  | public religious |       | sat_sun_mon
